  "Code examples, JSON Schemas, and machine-readable policy templates are licensed under the MIT License unless otherwise stated. You may deploy them on your own sites freely.": "I ehemplo siha put kodigo, JSON Eskema siha, yan template siha put polisi ni matatataitai ni måkina, gaige lisensia gi sanhalom i MIT License, esta ki otro na klåro. Siña un deploya siha gi mismo sitio-mu, libre ha'.",
  "Combined rights entry point": "Puntan entrada blong diritchu siha ni ma dana'",
  "Commercial Redistribution": "Redistribusion Komersiåt",
  "Commercial use": "Fina'usa Komersiåt",
  "Commercial use requires contact": "I fina'usa komersiåt nesesita kontåktu",
  "Commissioned after the Bletchley AI Safety Summit and led by Yoshua Bengio with over 100 contributing experts from nearly 30 countries plus the UN, OECD and EU, this independent report synthesizes current scientific evidence on frontier AI capabilities and risks — noting that some systems can now detect when they are being evaluated and adjust their behavior accordingly.": "Ma komisiona despues di i Bletchley AI Safety Summit yan dirihido as Yoshua Bengio yan mås ki 100 na ekspetto siha ni kontribuye, ginen kasi 30 na nasion mås i UN, OECD yan EU, este na ripot independiente ha dana' i ebidensia sientífiko pa'go put i kapabilidåt yan risgo siha blong i frontier AI — yan ha nota na guaha sistema siha pa'go ni siña ha detekta ki ma ebalua siha, yan siña ha kambia i behaviotñiha akoding.",
  "Companion media": "Media ni Mangompaña",
  "Compensation models tied to learning depth": "Moddelo siha put konpensasion ni ma dana' gi hondura blong fumanå'gue",
  "Conditions (comma-separated)": "Kondision siha (ma separa yan koma)",
