  "English edition →": "Edision gi Fino' Engles →",
  "Ensure openness is machine-executable — so goodwill is not discarded as legal uncertainty.": "Asegura na i hinababa siña ma ripela pot medio måkina — para i mauleg na hinasso ti ma yute' komo antaseten legåt.",
  "Epistemology": "Epistemolohia",
